    "sections": {
        "description": "FSE Handyman is a forward-looking, SEO-powered WordPress theme designed for home repair contractors, plumbers, electricians, and service businesses eager to build trust and visibility online. Built with Full Site Editing, this theme provides total control over site elements—banners, testimonials, service listings, and CTAs—to highlight your expertise. Its highly responsive, mobile-friendly design is paired with clean code and fast load speeds for top rankings in local search. Structured headings, schema markup, and review sections boost your presence for terms like “handyman WordPress theme” and “repair services website.” Translate easily to reach more clients, and benefit from WooCommerce compatibility if you sell products or accept bookings. FSE Handyman’s professional look is complemented by engaging visuals and calls to action, increasing conversion rates. It gives solo contractors and agencies alike the tools to appear trustworthy, get found by more customers, and grow their business while projecting credibility to every visitor."
    },
